mapaccuracy Python port

This repository is an unofficial, LLM-assisted Python port of the
mapaccuracy R package originally developed by Hugo Costa:

https://github.com/hagc/mapaccuracy

The original R package is licensed under the MIT License:

Copyright (c) 2021 Hugo Costa

The Python port, Python-specific tests, packaging, and documentation
were prepared and reviewed by Timothée Stassin in 2026.

The statistical estimators implemented by this package are described in
the scientific publications cited in the README.